{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Game Overview\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633740/extras/screenshot_1.png?t=1750232293\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a fast-paced RPG. The protagonist, Julie, has had her soul transformed into a Futanari monster by the demon goddess Lia. To thwart the plans of the goddess Liss\u2014and to satisfy her own desires\u2014Julie sets off on an adventure in a world filled with many beautiful and charming women!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Gameplay\u3011</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quick Devouring</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aside from essential story battles and elite enemies, players don\u2019t need to engage in traditional combat. Weaker monsters are instantly devoured upon collision, allowing Julie to grow stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633740/extras/GIF1_EN.gif?t=1750232293\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elite Enemies</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeating tough enemies rewards special items that make it even easier for Julie to dominate the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633740/extras/shop_screenshot_2.png?t=1750232293\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633740/extras/GIF2_EN.gif?t=1750232293\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collection System</strong></p></li></u